# Responsive = narrow fit **and** graceful growth

Canonical: `docs/DESIGN.md` § **Always responsive** · `docs/WEBSITES.md` “See every tier”.

## Law

Looking good on mobile is **not** enough. If Fit chips / short paired controls
fit on one line at the current content width, they **must** be one line.
Empty horizontal space beside a forever-`Down` toolbar on desk is a bug.

## Do / don't

```text
❌ Hard-code flow: Down for ← → Pause / − Speed + because phone once stacked badly
❌ “Never put this in ROWS” → leave Down at every width
❌ ActionStack for short Fit chip pairs that fit one desk row
❌ Ship after phone-only screenshots

✅ Stack / wrap only when measured content width cannot hold the Fit children
✅ apply_responsive: Right (or two Fit groups side-by-side) once wide enough
✅ ActionRow / Right strip for short chips; ActionStack for multi-word full-width CTAs
✅ Check 320, 360, 390 **and** 1280, 1920
```

## Exceptions (judge intent — do **not** blindly “fix”)

Law targets **chrome / Fit toolbars** with empty desk space. Other
stacks may be intentional. Many exceptions are obvious; still take care —
if unsure, leave it and check docs / owner intent.

```text
❌ Flatten every Down stack on a wide window “because responsive”
❌ Force more Floor / board / bill columns just because the window is wide
❌ Rewrite floor_columns / *_column_count so a user pick loses to width
❌ Treat intentional form stacks / full-width ActionStack CTAs as the bug

✅ Fix forever-Down Fit chip toolbars (play/speed, pagers, short pairs)
✅ User-owned density: pick wins; Auto/Fit/0 may still grow with width
✅ When unsure → leave alone
```

## Known failure (2026-11-21)

Khaynjo.com world-shelf `shelf_bar`: two permanent rows on a large desktop
while the right half of the band was empty. Fix: one `ScrollX` Fit strip
with icon play/pause + numeric speed (no "Pause"/"Speed" labels); pans
when chips do not fit on a phone.
